<tab><cl=F0F010>WORKSHOP<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab> In the <cl=FFFFFF>Workshop you<cl=B0B0B0> can enchant or repair things.
To do this, you need to put the formula and the necessary ingredients in the slots.
To make a craft, you need to agree with the price that the crafter will assign by clicking on the check mark.
All ingredients must match the formula. In case of unsuccessful crafting, the money will not be refunded.
The crafted item is put in the inventory, so leave at least one slot free.
}